<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Mills cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Mills cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded General Mills Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate and kept the long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 58-5/8 on Friday.</p>
</text>
